        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Kensington Palace, London\n- Systems: Kensington System\n- People: Queen Victoria, Victoria's mother, Duke and Duchess of Cambridge, Prince Harry, Duke and Duchess of Gloucester, Duke and Duchess of Kent, Prince and Princess Michael of Kent\n- Organizations: British Royal Family\n\nFacts:\n- Queen Victoria resided with her mother at Kensington Palace in London before she acceded to the throne.\n- The Kensington System is named after Kensington Palace in London.\n- Kensington Palace has been a residence of the British Royal Family since the 17th century.\n- Kensington Palace is currently the official London residence of the Duke and Duchess of Cambridge, Prince Harry, the Duke and Duchess of Gloucester, the Duke and Duchess of Kent, and Prince and Princess Michael of Kent.",
